# ── Live content CSV URLs (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────
# One per Sheet tab. Format: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/<SHEET_ID>/gviz/tq?tqx=out:csv&sheet=<Tab Name>
# IMPORTANT: the Sheet must be shared as "Anyone with the link – Viewer"
# (or published to web) for these URLs to return real CSV instead of a
# Google sign-in page. As of this writing the Sheet is NOT publicly shared
# (verified: the URL below returns HTTP 401) — until sharing is changed,
# every one of these safely no-ops and each page falls back to its local
# content/*.json, exactly as designed. Nothing breaks either way.
